# 🔟 Recurrence Relation

To reach:

```text
Nth Stair
```

You can come from:

```text
n-1

or

n-2
```

Therefore:

```cpp
dp[n]
=
dp[n-1]
+
dp[n-2]
```

Exactly Fibonacci.

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N)

Space: O(N)
```

