# 1️⃣1️⃣ Frog Jump

## Problem

A frog can jump:

```text
1 step

or

2 steps
```

Energy cost:

```text
abs(
height[i]
-
height[j]
)
```

Minimize total energy.

---

### Example

```text
10 20 30 10
```

Answer:

```text
