```

---

# 1️⃣2️⃣ Recurrence

```cpp
dp[i]
=
min(
dp[i-1]
+
abs(
h[i]
-
h[i-1]
),

dp[i-2]
+
abs(
h[i]
-
h[i-2]
)
)
```

---

### Memoization Code

```cpp
int solve(
    int index,
    vector<int>& h,
    vector<int>& dp)
{
    if(index == 0)
        return 0;

    if(dp[index] != -1)
        return dp[index];

    int left =
        solve(
            index-1,
            h,
            dp
        )
        +
        abs(
            h[index]
            -
            h[index-1]
        );

    int right = INT_MAX;

    if(index > 1)
    {
        right =
        solve(
            index-2,
            h,
            dp
        )
        +
        abs(
            h[index]
            -
            h[index-2]
        );
    }

    return dp[index] =
        min(left,right);
}
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N)

Space: O(N)
```

