# 1️⃣3️⃣ House Robber

## Problem

Rob houses.

Cannot rob:

```text
Adjacent Houses
```

---

### Example

```text
2 7 9 3 1
```

Answer:

```text
12
```

Choose:

```text
2 + 9 + 1
```

---

# 1️⃣4️⃣ Recurrence

At every house:

### Option 1

```text
Pick Current House
```

Then:

```text
Skip Previous House
```

---

### Option 2

```text
Do Not Pick
```

---

Formula:

```cpp
dp[i]
=
max(
arr[i]
+
dp[i-2],

dp[i-1]
)
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N)

Space: O(N)
```

